  "result": "Both failures are fixed, and all 243 tests now pass. I didn't touch the tests.\n\nThe bug was in `total()` in `src/cart.js`. It applied tax first and the discount second, but the comments say discounts come off the pre-tax subtotal. That made fixed discounts come off after tax, which gave 90 instead of 88 in one test.\n\nIt also let a fixed discount larger than the subtotal push the total below zero. The new order is:\n1. Apply the discount to the subtotal.\n2. Clamp the result at 0.\n3. Apply tax to what's left.",
